          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">User tips</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 space-y-2">
            <li>for the application, a “project” is simply a folder containing scans, so it is best to work in separate folders for each set of scans,</li>
            <li>after automatic reading, the text should always be checked manually,</li>
            <li>special attention should be paid to named entities, dates, and numbers,</li>
            <li>the magnifier and image filters are particularly useful for manuscripts and low-quality scans,</li>
            <li>export to TEI-XML may serve as a convenient starting point for further scholarly processing of the source material.
            </li>
          </ul>

